 "bsky_posts": [
  {
   "text": "Personally I think that Google censoring basic facts about the 2020 election as if it were a question of what happened in Tiananmen Square, specifically for US audiences, is the type of thing that would merit some executives explaining themselves before Congress, even if Gemini chatbot is speech.",
   "handle": "lessdismalsci.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Spooky Steve",
   "likes": 1469,
   "reposts": 317,
   "replies": 20,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T16:29:07.661Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lessdismalsci.bsky.social/post/3myx6byogac2x",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Gemini"
  },
  {
   "text": "Just saw a Shopify ad featuring MrBeast where the centrepiece pitch was using their AI agent to generate misleading images of your products.",
   "handle": "foldablehuman.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Dan Olson",
   "likes": 1563,
   "reposts": 111,
   "replies": 36,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:06:16.259Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/foldablehuman.bsky.social/post/3myw3iajqhs2u",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "Anthropic is saying that AI models could pose catastrophic or existential risks to humanity.\n\nAt the same time, Anthropic is planning the largest IPO in history, which would accelerate the development of this technology while leaving Americans holding the bag if the AI bubble bursts.",
   "handle": "warren.senate.gov",
   "display_name": "Elizabeth Warren",
   "likes": 1050,
   "reposts": 308,
   "replies": 68,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T13:50:02.824Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/warren.senate.gov/post/3mywvfjz4e22x",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "The techno-dystopia I fear is not one where an LLM becomes sentient, developing both a desire and means to wipe out humanity, but one where people come to believe that truth is whatever Claude, Gemini, ChatGPT, or Grok say, and the few very rich people who own them use that to manipulate the public.",
   "handle": "nicholasgrossman.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Nicholas Grossman",
   "likes": 756,
   "reposts": 234,
   "replies": 31,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T14:04:58.115Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/nicholasgrossman.bsky.social/post/3mywwa7t6yk2o",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "This whole story is infurating, but this first quote from someone at OpenAI is really making me see red. \"The newer version won't do this\": a) why the fuck should we believe you and b) even if so, that has fuck-all to do with OpenAI's culpability here.\n\nwww.nytimes.com/2026/10/27/w...",
   "handle": "emilymbender.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Emily M. Bender",
   "likes": 780,
   "reposts": 193,
   "replies": 24,
   "created_at": "2026-10-27T19:21:23.486Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emilymbender.bsky.social/post/3myuxh47zdk2z",
   "image": "img/2026-10-29/56ab97e51a24ad5e.webp",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "Google has specifically prevented its AI tool from telling users who won the 2020 presidential election, even though it happily tells us that Trump won in 2016 and 2024. This sort of political intervention into LLM responses is deeply problematic. (h/t to Charles Mann)",
   "handle": "zekehausfather.com",
   "display_name": "Zeke Hausfather",
   "likes": 534,
   "reposts": 238,
   "replies": 103,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T18:21:56.000Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zekehausfather.com/post/3myxelqqpdb2d",
   "image": "img/2026-10-29/5e61014d8376534d.webp",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "1st shot - default location (Toronto)\n\nSecond shot- VPN set to New York.",
   "handle": "lizrummy.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Emoji Caresser",
   "likes": 394,
   "reposts": 108,
   "replies": 12,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T14:19:27.317Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lizrummy.bsky.social/post/3mywx24r6zk2i",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Gemini"
  },
  {
   "text": "weird thing i have tried to describe before where LLM mistakes are simply inhuman. like they are entire types of mistakes that were unfathomable previously, literally could not have been made because the specific mix of competence and stupidity necessary was impossible",
   "handle": "segyges.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "SE Gyges",
   "likes": 499,
   "reposts": 42,
   "replies": 21,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T00:34:31.564Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/segyges.bsky.social/post/3myviwzwmrs2q",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "The thing is…AI doesn’t have hands. \n\nLiterally, no hands. \n\narstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/a...",
   "handle": "tressiemcphd.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Tressie McMillan Cottom",
   "likes": 433,
   "reposts": 47,
   "replies": 20,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T14:46:58.956Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tressiemcphd.bsky.social/post/3mywyldv6r22h",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/anthropic-ipo-warns-its-ai-could-blackmail-people-become-sentient-end-humanity/?utm_source=bsky&utm_medium=social",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "The thing is, if AI is customizing recipes, why bother with a NYT subscription in the first place? Just go ask Claude instead. \n\nKnowledge of recipes is no longer a limiting factor to home cooking, it's now ability, intuition, and technique that help with home cooking.",
   "handle": "esqueer.net",
   "display_name": "Alejandra Caraballo",
   "likes": 368,
   "reposts": 51,
   "replies": 27,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:17:43.723Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/esqueer.net/post/3myw44q5h2k2o",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Claude AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "It will never not fuck me up that Anthropic is like \"hello our product may end humanity\" and the market is like \"sure, a $1.6 T valuation makes sense, take our money.\"",
   "handle": "courtneymilan.com",
   "display_name": "Courtney Milan",
   "likes": 331,
   "reposts": 34,
   "replies": 8,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T19:28:17.346Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/courtneymilan.com/post/3myxiceerik2u",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "Please please please let the likes of OpenAI and Anthropic and Claude be next",
   "handle": "troisnyx.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Troisnyx",
   "likes": 367,
   "reposts": 10,
   "replies": 2,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:33:30.526Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/troisnyx.bsky.social/post/3myw4yx3oc22i",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "feeling UNREASONABLY PROUD of my first year writing student today who, holding an LLM-generated paper in her hand said, “this thesis doesn’t actually argue anything? This isn’t even a research paper actually? WHAT EVEN IS THIS??”\n\nExactly froglet\n\nExactly 🥹🥹",
   "handle": "swilua.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "🌈Dr. Frizzle",
   "likes": 273,
   "reposts": 21,
   "replies": 5,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:49:12.338Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/swilua.bsky.social/post/3myxq6doqkc24",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm tired of hearing excuses about \"well that model wasn't that great\" or \"the product is responsible [not the execs who released it].\"\n\nWe all know the best realistic scenario is that OpenAI pays this woman's parents a few dollars.\n\nReally OpenAI execs should be held liable for this woman's death.",
   "handle": "dawnxianamoon.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Dawn Xiana Moon",
   "likes": 194,
   "reposts": 47,
   "replies": 6,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:44:23.707Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/dawnxianamoon.bsky.social/post/3myw5mfz4fs2v",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "ChatGPTが抗てんかん薬の減薬を指南、31歳女性の急死でOpenAIを提訴\nfinance.biggo.jp/news/4d466db...\n\n「かかりつけ医の診察を前に減薬の計画を「しゃべらないように」と助言し、血中濃度を測る検査を拒否した判断を称賛するやり取りも記録されていた。」\n\nドン引き",
   "handle": "hasu2010.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "hasu",
   "likes": 108,
   "reposts": 81,
   "replies": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T14:13:46.174Z",
