   "image": "",
   "external": "https://finance.biggo.jp/news/4d466db3-d635-4106-a540-83d80d3463ab",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "truthout.org/articles/as-...",
   "handle": "charleskeener.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Charles Keener",
   "likes": 143,
   "reposts": 59,
   "replies": 4,
   "created_at": "2026-10-28T03:22:01.874Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/charleskeener.bsky.social/post/3myvscknqnc2x",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://truthout.org/articles/as-the-ai-bubble-threatens-to-burst-we-must-prepare-to-fight-a-big-tech-bailout/",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "tl;dr\n“Knowing all of this, why would you invite ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, Muse, & AI search engine results into your home? Why would you give them money? Or any information about you? & if you’re a professional physicist or mathematician, why in the ever-living fuck would you collaborate with them?”",
